        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Double Thumbturn  Privacy Lock for Double Pocket Doors </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors that need easy locking from both sides of the door. The heavy duty solid brass double pocket door privacy lock has <b>thumbturns on interior and exterior</b> to lock or unlock it. The double pocket door lock set with Thumbturns on Both Sides comes with everything you need to install on a set of sliding pocket doors to secure them together. Both have a flip up edge pull so you can easily get doors out of their pockets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Double Thumbturn Privacy Function:</b> This set locks via the thumbturn on both the exterior and the interior. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLASDAR.jpg?v=1704354589\" width=\"600\" height=\"135\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDLA325 Pocket Door Privacy Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe privacy lock is installed on one door while the receiver is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are hooked together.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/double-thumbturn-pocket-door-lock-sdlla325\"><b>Single Pocket Door Double Thumbturn Privacy Lock</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/double-pocket-door-privacy-lock-set-deltana-sdla-sdar\"><b>Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b></a> with standard coin turn exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the  SDLLA325/SDAR325 Double Thumbturn  Privacy Lock for Double Pocket Doors:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Receiver Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Receiver Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-3/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li><b>Thumbturn on both sides of the lock.</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLLA325SDAR325-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262401\" target=\"new\"><b>SDLLASDAR Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLLA325-install.pdf?v=1704262350\" target=\"new\"><b>SDLLA325 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on double  pocket sliding doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
