                "description": "For use on sliding pocket doors that need easy locking from both sides of the door. The Heavy Duty Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock has thumbturns on interior and exterior to lock or unlock it. The Double Pocket Door Lock Set with Thumbturns on Both Sides comes with everything you need to install on a set of sliding double doors to secure them together.",
